    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d40">

                <pb facs="0137" n="17" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg17"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Haitian Minister to the Acting Secretary of
                        State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Deer Park, Md.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-07-01"><hi rendition="#italic">July 1,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have heard with sorrow of the death of Hon. John Hay. In my name and in the
                    name of the Haitian Government, I beg to convey our heartfelt condolence to the
                    people and the Government of the United States.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">J. N. Léger.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
